{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3b8fdecd154f8f522be0741d62df2c440ede4b437ed761f20d5224ba590f156d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:720d326a0cceaae8227d355f40764fc98a45069a6ccfceae89241fed58be343c",
      "text": "掷出的315点",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b74e6b3dc69ae2df94883e52afd6182bc43b28109f1b7d2230869ef3e38cb47e",
      "text": "虽然来到了315 Pro，但类和次郎却得知试镜的\n举办时间其实还在后头。\n然而凭借类的talking skills，\n情况却朝着意想不到的方向发展……？另一边道夫，\n收到了来自父亲的一份寄语。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000018:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:851f32e78985f5b441d8d086b8782f09b00f4cc9633468b884231e293ac344f8",
      "text": "第4话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000018:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:720d326a0cceaae8227d355f40764fc98a45069a6ccfceae89241fed58be343c",
      "text": "掷出的315点",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1eea9209ae61a248f2bd6f46aea08ac935ef602ada12aa5aaf51c50ec487fb6a",
      "text": "事务所·会议室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07ecc8c34ed9f985d8bf745105c3e8d5495ebd473930716b3e126c8ffa1b1033",
      "text": "呼，原来如此……虽然是不请自来，\n承蒙您告诉了我们很多关于偶像的事情，真是帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75607cc5ab1ccedff3dedcb164fe9ff5d40df9563d4744b9c6fca4d37ff62e0a",
      "text": "（正如预料的那样，看起来是家刚成立的事务所，\n但氛围相当不错……不过，根据刚才的说法）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae424a05bfd0f9f7537080aaa8ab054be00df8eefa1cdde68f05fe124a51b98e",
      "text": "（今天的试镜刚刚结束。\n下一次举办，还得过一阵子……吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c1367e99693ed3a5abcfb4db2323a8f8d04ba4b0c7b1a43f8de5852d4e1e2eb",
      "text": "……那个，我可以提个question吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38900d90a3e42d2ddfc4f984cd30a2ba7dc157768ec4a0351f0c671f70cccb44",
      "text": "参加试镜的人，\n果然还是比我们年轻的孩子占多数吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb56e5942362dac70a22faa3b2f45ed98492d3997c5ac5e7f6535aa33593e421",
      "text": "嗯——是呢。\n从整体比例来看，感觉确实是……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9c84920c85bd266ebffe4d3871e120e71326aaa2c0b68e3db9c8c6d2a00e50f",
      "text": "年轻孩子光鲜亮丽固然很棒☆ ……But，\n有时候光有那个也会不够的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_a:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17ccfd5c61cb76af7b787aa4eb56df38c4e0aa109585fc1d44365ef6e19efced",
      "text": "……您的意思是？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44cddfe0281b8f12a44bcb057ba591e369ee11506f1ae62b6d90f5311bea8bae",
      "text": "就是所谓的Variety啦！比如，\n当client需要adult又sexy的image时？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd8b9f8474e026188b23783a82529f7599095478f52533cd6214603825d1088e",
      "text": "如果只有年轻的idol，\n难得的offer可就接不下来了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce18e654a09fbd6a1af4bfbf176c326794b72a296ee836cf46799c7c35b6c850",
      "text": "但是，如果有像我们这样的人在事务所里，\n那种时候说不定就能派上用场哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3556017419f6503f2cdf327f4e98d075529363b0846465200ab7ecc79910d20",
      "text": "而且我们可是前teachers！这份career，\n在偶像的世界里说不定也能成为武器吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9e33a6641064a7b25398cb5a5d08cf3898fc5d17b93629335fc61c4a0253a14",
      "text": "（大概是因为在学校里经常和很多人说话吧。谈吐太优秀了，让人忍不住想听他说得更多！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6829704107a2d820c86ebb61be00034a5cd8e9fb312dd2629e83766a284f1fb",
      "text": "我想再多听听二位的故事！\n贤君，不好意思……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d26727fdab68af63bcd7ec49cecd33400472891dbe45b1ef7498881c68c68591",
      "text": "我们想重启试镜，\n能麻烦你准备一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0584d47a40f5ee54a3218241be556a4cfd4b4099effc42cdc192231b6c11518c",
      "text": "当然，前提是二位时间方便的话……\n不知意下如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6814b9add2d4e9fca779254bbe9adb18494443a6fcf1d7d5f203157cf2da828",
      "text": "……诶。这么说，\n是现在就能给我们办试镜的意思吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81e08f11861b204ae6d7c7db7a4dad0f36164e70bb5e3319240ee6b34748c255",
      "text": "要做要做！我们两个时间完全no problem☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:819186026a34433c39c10147ce485e6f3aa97b811d78cbc0f236f2df4dfb11fb",
      "text": "Mr. 山下，这可是big chance哦。\n是只为我们准备的特别试镜啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a650ad5498a57735b8375412be8899e4262548bf48f67b38cce4cb14876b32ba",
      "text": "Hurry, hurry！\n得赶紧call Mr. 硲叫他过来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_b:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8665f6ee83d6fa24a7e5f46a709965bd8923219d68c7252473466586f4ffd543",
      "text": "诶？啊、也是呢。\n那个，手机手机……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d3f41b6b9316bb639391b0e2bd41a68d3699e3fc99788a121bbb2346bfa2494",
      "text": "唔，原来如此……\n你突然放弃教师职务的理由，我明白了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_c:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc85bac70c5963c084bc1cf323f6c763cc1c6fe77dc56eadef4ff3df9a92c997",
      "text": "乍看之下，或许是有些突兀的举动。\n但结论而言，我赞同你的想法。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f438e0cfd62f6eee4d1fa45ed4d29f1a7854902750ab5350c06e31c740b12797",
      "text": "如你所言，偶像这种存在，\n确实有可能成为陪伴年轻人左右的良好教育者。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca18571f88e4c93ebbbaae7333d5901732bd5aa92ef31e303ec0d1efc712ee38",
      "text": "是的。偶像的言行举止更容易被善意接纳，\n并能对他们的生活、梦想和目标产生影响。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_c:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32f60d3be2e34c356e28ba26d21a30c110e290cef818cb734a8804c02d1559cd",
      "text": "当然，我并不认为自己\n立刻就能成为那样的偶像。但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_c:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69508f08ec1be2590ae1ca194e9ae84b1e868c4662429cee832cf8551f32f895",
      "text": "为了引导年轻人们，我会像做教师时一样，\n毫不吝惜地付出努力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fa0c608617b249e52f5ac974c58013f89759104d45bdd4a536625fed9da3a02",
      "text": "是啊……\n道夫的成绩单上，向来全都是双圈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2112a3429176d1b34b0872f53e1a95f236160a64af31dcac3a626dc5fb7660b",
      "text": "小时候是这样，今后也一样。\n你一直都是让我引以为傲的认真儿子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da06ae85538390e88355eb786eb8141637f302f5a993650b6a6e8dd6c3ce03ca",
      "text": "无论是作为父亲，还是作为教师，我都可以断言。\n这份认真，无论走到哪里都是闪耀的力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9e0d90bd79cc4ac893989dcdd886a8a630fa6b839e39a4afe282fec318f28d1",
      "text": "朝着你心中的全新理想教育者形象，\n无所畏惧地前进吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d14bb38149f28654ad3a56cc91a9624d2df580766e3d44feac5aa20278b9970c",
      "text": "是的。……谢谢您，父亲。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:229adf2f8f4fdd1b18b7ee1eab6acec66a9b634b7e10c366142a68dbfa3cd986",
      "text": "（硲先生发了照片过来。\n什么时候发的……诶，这是什么）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9d2f52708fce46e5b9b6854982149a151f2546d16f9d69a544292675b933561",
      "text": "（每张照片上都是摆着奇怪姿势的硲先生。\n……那个人，又琢磨出什么东西来了吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8859b5c62ebac66da08fbe03fb20b38b8355296d441aaeb22689bf382d2b72be",
      "text": "请问怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:792803cc150d46ca5348a150e7032e66735f615f490c6555ed54de77cdd88ae8",
      "text": "Sorry，其实，除了我们之外，还有一个\n一起以偶像为目标的friend在。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d37b3bd63ecb6ce9ced65b453d87bfa5d21a332e94f10e87adc879072c157a1f",
      "text": "我现在马上叫他过来，\n试镜能不能wait a moment, please☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42232196cc8aa057a9e2df2fd7107fb709b5ba7406bc646c5c05bc97f1395a93",
      "text": "没问题的！\n不如说是我这边突然提出要求，实在不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fa0b5475a400426ecb1c466a59dee19c940c5656c33db726aaa6ab937915636",
      "text": "……喂类。\n能跟我一起看看这张照片吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_d:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3129d48b985de642f08f97f9002db8ca563f8bf419e40e6a703183401a7b6ce4",
      "text": "Wow！Mr. 硲，so mysterious！\n写在下面的这些，就是这张照片和姿势的说明吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_d:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47478f8b52716d7ed31209a59440579aced3cafd5cbd14c24b7e2938384e4d98",
      "text": "“关于上次成为课题的‘给评委留下深刻印象的\n展示方式’，我按照自己的思路进行了一番构想”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_d:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8aadc213128f9f2ccb1ac3cc6828f2938a4fdeb4942f6a0ea674c0df2a51115b",
      "text": "“将我们的热情不仅通过言语，\n而是通过视觉化的姿势来传达，不知意下如何”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_d:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65683562dfe298c5c9ac759c780fa2b5b73894a202a05ff3a5f75c8d57161c76",
      "text": "“我将其命名为‘热情姿势’”……这也太直接了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_d:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f9756beaecdc991e1ec646a37e0968f9666a2bfca348dd3a860664fdb8d1607",
      "text": "真棒，大家一起摆姿势感觉很有趣！\n我都开始WAKUWAKU起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_d:cmd-000141:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5adbe0a9dd61d04e46612a7d23b974b1296fccf368141e69a4cbd38e774ad11",
      "text": "类的话应该还说得过去吧……大叔们突然摆起姿势，\n不会觉得太脱离现实让人害怕吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_d:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cb160d873309d0ae238743789f391d54182a4307449473115a13fc7d975a3d02",
      "text": "也就是说，确实能带来冲击力吗……？\n不对，首先得打电话，打电话……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_e:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4a90abdd9547649d9a240c4ae9ea2fe02663d8407f99cccdc1b0730b2e4858b",
      "text": "必须比以往任何时候都更加努力才行了。\n和舞田君、山下君一起。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c7cd7ee9d609f823f5bda9bfb4f6f2d65c2d628247a35735d798f03757fc3fe",
      "text": "……山下君打来的？\n这样啊，是关于我发的那张照片的事吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_e:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5b8e204a53d88fc68d8fa0a63e003856635d149cf98dc9874982bd5d3bc9893",
      "text": "喂……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:836f777ead3b46a828643a5d238fd4a237e655337823ab887f1cafb797b0832b",
      "text": "啊，喂喂硲先生？\n那个～你说的要紧事，已经办完了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1d5b7db7bb0d6bf8e882210b7cac75684412ab2ad985c247cc6c30be6d42a1e",
      "text": "不好意思，希望你能火速赶到这边来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:706349ad23f368e11bab3083481181ad18ecdcbc9ffd838a3a3e3ceb9ab79a39",
      "text": "我知道了，告诉我你们现在的地点。\n正好去听听你们对那个姿势的坦率意见。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:249b2bd6a844eb02e439f304be4e71d4565c974441131289dbb16fc6326d1980",
      "text": "为了让大家对试镜和偶像投入的三人份热情\n能够一眼传达出来，我进行了属于我自己的研究……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ac7cb3ab98a8b0eab671481245bef68591dc8cc42374384ef88c232153505ad",
      "text": "我看了。不是，现在不是说这个的时候……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ceea3894ed9079d11797ac311f46b4a80aec799a6264c282ccf4641d7433e31",
      "text": "我们的试镜定下来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a7aa981ca04667c26ee5195645d19d309990d9cab595dbefc648aa64e7cbeb9",
      "text": "而且，参加者only我们几个人。\n能向评委many many展示我们自己哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32180110419d67e8085bc799931497d7ac2ad20078f4261281cbab5cfd63fbfc",
      "text": "时间是today＆now☆\n所以，快点come on，到315 Production来！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_f:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74368e5635c7a8914af49d871ec50192ccafca43ea2d751ca18b63479ac9ff13",
      "text": "……吸——呼——吸——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5192aa2b0f852e9f737f2e646e1d835e0ccd1925318fa08873a7026731441b88",
      "text": "真的没关系吗？您看起来是一路赶过来的，\n等您把气喘匀了再开始试镜也可以……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_f:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6be76fba199c8185c77c238326ec066aff835ce9f2e0f0b89f6c4e07a508447",
      "text": "……不。呼吸很快就能调整好。没有问题。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_f:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1acc248a50eebfa321ffb6d22565750fa3e825bcaa8cfed13ba73cd7479871ca",
      "text": "我本就到得晚了，\n不想再浪费更多的时间。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_f:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1283440f9c8be4fdc776a39fde24cffa6549298cde31c458bac7137884c1ae3d",
      "text": "哪怕多一分，我也想用在展示我们自己的时间上。\n……可以开始了吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_f:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e1cb632f61a581a0bee4580e64239d6ff110ae4893082817558de665c09e1e4",
      "text": "……我明白了。\n贤君，我们开始吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_f:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8639ce4753d9427e61105ea5a6dddaa98be7fc433a8b07b7e5e5299daca3acb4",
      "text": "那么各位，\n我带大家去试镜场地。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_f:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f4c45678fb81a45181ba25f30b6e4b39e7059a95fc5ce1adcd0efde98c984a4",
      "text": "……抱歉。本打算立刻赶过来的，路上遇到了堵车和\n晚点。后半程我跑着赶过来了，但还是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_f:cmd-000109:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d48f67c9d2a22cce37696807bab9c1d32fa22159dd5ec57ef4db35b68bdd8716",
      "text": "Oh，Mr. 硲。\n这事不如也在试镜里说吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_f:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c03db796ca5e50c91f444ee0424b080f2b240fc9b1767e0459db73a727234eb3",
      "text": "只要说你是一路running过来的，\n就能展示出我们有多tough了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_f:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f13cac81205e4c52b1da39700c70205a217eb856d987e0371bbe8fe32217b66e",
      "text": "……谢谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_f:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f87055ff2e95623e3208e7deba86c9eb71bf489367d4073b3459d0c82c83b86c",
      "text": "我今天之所以能站在这里，\n正是因为有你们这样的同伴在。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_f:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d9e81fcc827306d73b51576f8334c1aa5f24510784945b85736f931d016c3a6",
      "text": "硲先生，试镜现在才要开始呢。\n感谢的话，请等拿到合格通知之后再说吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_f:cmd-000146:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:559865de658ddedb087436917aaf97e799dc92bfebc78d997d4a85bcd490295b",
      "text": "Alright，这次一定要合格哦！\n因为我们可是拥有new weapon的嘛☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6eca5bbb1fa78d35aa198d3e81e0dba68b9083054421ede6d539e7ce9a5b7d45",
      "text": "试镜场地",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19a0839e930e1d0a81092ef708f822f76d6886b43af638fa5a070e198b6289ea",
      "text": "各位原本在同一所学校担任教师啊。\n首先非常感谢各位的自我介绍！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7abe59d8c0bbd442d0dc64032519ce3d23d2e82a24a56c7b08e20bd514d26a7",
      "text": "那么接下来，请各位依次\n说说想要成为偶像的理由。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa8cbbf4657bacb7baef1de8d7c7862ef266a37fcf06b5f265af4532fee74fb0",
      "text": "为了让年轻人们萌生对学业的热情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fc83c209bc78d6657e3b15b7707acdf2cb835a7f477d612a6807c331835c316",
      "text": "之前作为教师，我一直都在做这方面的努力。\n但并不是用那种讲大道理的方法……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a4a13a85066f7904a408feb962c53cdcc0b44312083204d72e969aba666bd09",
      "text": "我呢，是因为被Mr. 硲邀请了☆\n觉得实在太exciting了，当天就……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:426cc0fecf38c69c4b2ce5c8b35161b7301346d9489f62484a1ae17e92184406",
      "text": "……听了他们的话，我就在偶像的世界里做起了发大财的梦。\n只是，在做的过程中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:204967dcf675b55e0b855356465f6c87ad5fc343583d33151292929f70d9fd7c",
      "text": "（……在之前的试镜里，\n也是这样一遍又一遍诉说着热情）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8240fc77bcf99c472ed76b1ae1c23d2fe11fd699669360c8e4ed392378af7f4b",
      "text": "（结果落得个10连败。投过的所有地方都没通过。\n……类虽然那么说）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9497dd634e0a7eaf3c9cd0a44f3990734aa6a213b61f65fc06d8b0cc4b200372",
      "text": "（也必须得考虑一下这次要是也不行该怎么办了呢）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000179:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78ea47ace5d2ce1888003ff17304546256b101e74ff41575dbeaca29af22f560",
      "text": "感谢各位的分享！\n那么，到这里就结束了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000184:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f64b1c889db2317abfb2ccd069b5a1805df913b47957ef7c6350d0f6a94f0e55",
      "text": "……不。为了传达我们的心意，\n还有一个东西，希望您能过目。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_g:cmd-000200:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e519d6e78f9edb0f768fafade2171cf23e88e4ce8a19c180e8a1f584b2cf0120",
      "text": "你们两个，准备好了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:527560a1274173a29aa9d38f087a353dd2e313d08789075638c0b0146bf62f66",
      "text": "OK！就是那个姿势对吧☆\nStand up，Mr. 山下！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_h:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a082f6d0fc579f01278871bbe921eac1d8abaa52336b0fc01efb73acd274cea9",
      "text": "（…………那个，奇怪的姿势）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_h:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ef719b39a09f7d86ba71a63e971df89fe2aa8ae79a5434720e74d863cdb0ebc",
      "text": "（无论是硲先生还是类，都打算极度认真、\n极度欢闹地摆出来啊……哈哈）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_h:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7182c37dff3ae31fd0bdb871c9c3bd4d7ce88a054df845d74db2b1004a2ff07",
      "text": "这就是我们倾注在偶像上的热情！\n……舞田君、山下君，上吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_h:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:124af7dc95c2e0abd1e641d03df08de30c7d43e357ca522bca3f707113aefdf2",
      "text": "热情姿势！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_h:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:608d8ce06dab991bae82435c98447256c3a58ffc1a33717e3bb83e83bcbe036b",
      "text": "（……这样到底行不行得通，已经习惯消极的\n我并不知道。但是，这里面……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_h:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:372f6041f6efde7933a064d49f1219ceadc83711f87ef9996086eba9921bdf8c",
      "text": "（有硲先生那种不可思议的不屈精神。\n有类无论何时、任何事都能乐在其中的心态）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_h:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fabf9b770de71b67864fa751359376b098ed8694269ae7910ead29620e742a27",
      "text": "（再加上作为搭头、与我形象不符的一场赌博。\n凝聚了我们三个人的一切，凝聚了我们的过往）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_h:cmd-000152:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85f3fcd69abe6a98ce2f53f8eea2ec2f2d95ad5d46704fbbed7f2b2ada755342",
      "text": "（所以……拜托了。\n哪怕是为了他们两个，也请顺利发展吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_i:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9487ec9f8c7d2be9fd4c3b714757429e8db38d4390cf26e9027bb66e7b4fbfa",
      "text": "太、太厉害了……感受到了来自他们三人的、令人心弦为之颤动的气魄呢，●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_i:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b7c9c101e886e7f21f512b177e10e7d55d9c186e8e8c64dd4a18e433d928843",
      "text": "是的。刚才的姿势，\n即使放在舞台上也是非常夺人眼球的吧……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_i:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c9f2324fca717733aa015c4d796872d91ba0768801f29184a6237e3528ac4c4",
      "text": "等正式的偶像活动开始后，\n我们也把那种舞台表现方式纳入考虑吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_i:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9adf1bebf22b58436ca31c2d18e931bcc67dfbbddb7e7db2bab2293df4e82c1c",
      "text": "各位，今后请多多关照啦。\n试镜，合格了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7742739cc7de478b4a1766d9feed56e623dda2271cd4d545119c168289146fa6",
      "text": "哎……？合格了？真的假的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_i:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e794e63e21021098e076a1d0d2e2b36bc3d4557655a63d16100a9490405915de",
      "text": "HYAHHO——！太好啦～～～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_i:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d87c23cdc855b5c07f11034b0c17b41c8f9bf423da55497570b767abd5e7b05",
      "text": "太好了，太棒了！\n我们三个人能一起当偶像了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_i:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f3058194020f39d3b7a0b1156b9449fef78e2d04865b93ea8ce49babac15020",
      "text": "合格……我们。这样啊……成功了吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_i:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0be140aeefee8d732266f2485fe5ee0bf6758428b448e06472e515c55fb3310a",
      "text": "是的！为了让各位能度过充满热情、激动人心、\n满载梦想的每一天。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_i:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:930a53dd998546b9e065070cde9787f5e40f18eb79d16cf6c604ae15eb08560a",
      "text": "315 Production会全力支援各位的。\n今后就请多多指教了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_i:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8f0b952b62f3f03b8314e0d05b153d0e00f9d302e3f66191a0ccfb1d067a674",
      "text": "Oh……thanks a lot，制作人酱！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:952676ca53e943bbbf79eb2d7eb2848facd494efb51085d1b7e3a4d2dee8e019",
      "text": "今后我们的事就拜托啦☆\n对了，赶紧来交换LINK吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_j:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba67bedbc78830dde3cdf591aa7baf6c41a70507b35242741455cb2b53361602",
      "text": "来，这是我的ID♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_j:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d94b7da5a4cc17ca3f7cee56a1752e50b17164af147d30cb67563f2a91eee9c9",
      "text": "类先生，很棒的个人资料照片呢！\n您很喜欢大海吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_j:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9bd02b6d832bdf9234ab771dde9a420485114a9b08e171f36ebe527392d798c5",
      "text": "Yes！我很喜欢在海里冲浪。\n和Friends一起去滑雪、滑单板、BBQ也都很喜欢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_j:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce5d5ef682d09419ee9641c986d4aa8927bcee6b2e9efe2ca8f023db3baa5cd7",
      "text": "从今天起，你也join到这当中了呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_j:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edff7a958f7c362d19a660bbba423e5b92d43cbb7184de4cf30d26366df005ac",
      "text": "因为你可是看好我们的可能性、给了我们chance的\n新buddy啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_j:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:744a0170f6748bc7abee041498ec91cced48dc2d6fd512f711e13120f140d341",
      "text": "也是呢……那个～你，\n真的是幸运之神吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_j:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:380e620a2d4c3abc243b239f58b6e26a84ed3a0d344424f370cdc6c14e5c4332",
      "text": "就像那天猜中赛马一样，\n难道连我们光明的未来，你也早就看到了吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_j:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10530206f366891c769b01030bfefea0379de1b4f1faa2e8c0ca6369c73c9c73",
      "text": "能否将其化为现实，\n取决于我们今后的努力，山下君。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_j:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ac274798103ae473c71363add25e71625e785912883ddbef00dff719d2b64f5",
      "text": "……虽然舞田君也说过了，但你能给我们这个\n挑战偶像世界的机会，我非常感激。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_j:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03341d2247974dbf1edcc972e2a68b8447fad4ea57a5843e69184c8eeeb8f942",
      "text": "在实现梦想之前，我们将竭尽全力。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_j:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ab0da2aedccef02a6cb32d40f62a570ccbabec343a99e03af22e6fbb3d391ff",
      "text": "我很期待身为制作人的你的周密指示，\n以及在偶像方面的悉心指导与鞭策。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_j:cmd-000173:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a981ed8279fceef6028460330d689ee8d64a0569a1a3db45c6c5226662b3bdc6",
      "text": "……虽然这人是这么说的。\n但大叔们……尤其是我，各方面都已经不再年轻了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_012sem_04_1_1_012_04:1_1_012_04_j:cmd-000185:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af09b5044e8706ba34c8910a3e6cb308dc29dc17757581cb636dd4ebdcaf2c5f",
      "text": "刚才说的“全力支援”，\n也要按照约定，多多拜托啦？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
